WEBVTT

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:08.460
<b>SUPER</b>

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:08.460
<b>SPECIAL</b>

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:08.460
<b>MOVE</b>

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.080
Continuing from last time, I wanna come up with a
special attack that's good for a Shadow Mistress like me!

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.000
<b>MR. SHIROSAWA'S SUPER MOVE</b>

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.670
A super move? I hardly have
any combat power compared to humans.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.540
But I do have a specialty.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.920
My species is known for being exceptional
at fortune telling and prophecies.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.420
Back in our home country,

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:24.250
we made our living by staying at the homes
of influential people and advising them on the future.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.170
This path may lead you to a silver mine.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.250
<b>This path may lead you</b>

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.250
<b>to a silver mine</b>

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:26.960
Whoa.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.210
<b>Whoa</b>

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Look up "Bai Ze" if you want to know more.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.790
Fortune telling? Oh, do me!

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.880
I'm not as good now as I was in my prime,
but I can demonstrate for you.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.960
You occasionally find yourself lacking confidence.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.500
Wow! You're right!

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.210
You are regarded by others
as the type who can't say "no."

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:43.710
Wow! You're right!

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.880
Doesn't take much to impress you, huh, Shamiko?

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:47.380
<b>LICO'S SUPER MOVE</b>

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.380
I don't have any of those fancy-schmancy attacks,

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.080
but I do keep a little something up my sleeve
for dealing with priestesses.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.000
Really? I wanna see it!

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.210
Um, well, I don't want to show you with Momo around.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:01.250
I mean, there may be a time down the road
when it comes in handy...

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.500
Exactly what kind of scenario
are you imagining that it would?

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.830
Okay! I've got a real simple one
that I can show you here and now.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Momo, hun? Could you drink this for me?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.040
I'm not drinking any liquid that's such a crazy color!

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.210
Yeah, that figures.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.500
Momo, hun? Could you go clean up the glasses
that are left on the counter?

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:19.330
Not until you explain why there's something
that looks like a pitfall trap over there.

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:34.670
Doki doki wa kore kara!

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:42.580
Kiseki okoru yokan

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:48.210
Henachoko sajikagen de ii desho iza susume!

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.880
Ichika bachika yukeru donna basho datte
Henachoko sajikagen de ii desho iza susume!<b></b>

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.830
Ichika bachika yukeru donna basho datte

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:57.540
Motto kikasete core no oto made

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:02.330
Futari te o awasetara kowaku nai yo

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.710
Komatta toki ni wa

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.080
Omoidashite

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:10.830
Kimi ga iru tte koto

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:18.460
Onaji sora futari de miagete

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:22.830
Waraiatte tsurai koto mo norikoechaou

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:28.130
Dareka no tame ni ganbaru koto

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.670
Sore mo warukunai

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:35.290
Kyou mo tonari de

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:42.380
Tokimeki wa kore kara!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.960
<b>PITCH-BLACK FEELINGS!!</b>

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.960
<b>DARKNESS PEACH RETURNS!!</b>

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.920
<b>Morning Run</b>

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.920
<b>Snooze</b>

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.920
<b>Sleep</b>

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.960
<b>Morning Run</b>

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.960
<b>Snooze</b>

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.960
<b>Sleep</b>

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:06.380
This morning, Momo Chiyoda
was feeling somewhat strange when she woke up.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.170
Good morning. What's up with your voice today, Metako?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.580
<b>Crack!!</b>

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.580
Huh? My glass just broke...

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:48.500
What the-?

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.170
A form that should still be fresh in your memories.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:55.880
Yes, you know it and love it!
The dark side form of Magical Girl, Momo Chiyoda!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.580
M-Momo, is everything okay?!

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.710
There was a big noise and flashy lights
that reached all the way to my room!

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.130
Shamiko...

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.960
Somehow I ended up going to the dark side again.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.380
Huh?

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:07.630
But why...?

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:08.920
How?!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:09.920
I don't know.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.830
Also, I can't revert to my normal form.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.290
Wha-? Wha-?! WHAAAAAAAAA?!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.540
This is nuts!

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.500
<b>TUMMY</b>

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.500
<b>TUMMY</b>

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.500
<b>TUMMY</b>

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:19.290
<b>TUMMY</b>

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:19.250
Tummy... tummy... tummy...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.790
So, hey, can I go ahead and rub your tummy?

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:19.290
<b>TUMMY</b>

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.250
You're gonna have to save that for later!

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.750
<b>BANDA TERRACE</b>

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.750
Oh dear. You don't seem very chipper today, boy.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.540
Are you okay, physically?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.170
Well, it doesn't hurt or make me feel tired.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:31.500
But I'm unable to regulate the amount
of magic power being used to move my body.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.880
See? I can't hold my strength back at all.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.130
It's like my magic is constantly
discharging at max capacity.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.290
That seems like something
even the regular Momo could do!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.460
<b>That seems</b>

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.460
<b>like something</b>

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.460
<b>even the regular</b>

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.460
<b>Momo could do!</b>

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:43.080
At this rate, my magic will run out quickly
and I'll end up nothing but a core.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.920
So, I need to revert back to normal ASAP.

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.210
It's so sad that we have to say goodbye to you, Momo!

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.130
You better make a bucketload
of doll vessels before you go!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:54.750
I could grind your statue
into dust right now if I wanted to.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.790
Right! I'll just be quiet over here.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.000
<b>YOSHIDA</b>

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.210
Let's get going.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.250
I may revert back like last time
if we have Mikan shoot me again.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:06.500
I'll be honest, I wish I didn't have
to see you go through that over and over.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.210
Does it bother you or something?

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:09.790
Huh? Well, yeah...

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.040
It's like the boss was explaining to us yesterday.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:17.460
I understand that you all used some extreme measures
when Lady Momo gave herself to the darkness.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.210
Swallowing strange elixirs
and forcibly changing her class.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.920
That's likely what caused her core
to become so unstable.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:28.500
It made me realize the way you went
to the dark side last time was just too reckless.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.460
But I had to do something back then, because not
taking action would have made me feel like garbage.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:35.290
I have no regrets about my decision.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.080
So please don't let it bother you.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.670
If you say so.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.580
Let's stay calm and focus on doing what we can.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.080
R-right.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.330
On another note, what is up with that string?

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.000
<b>Creep...</b>

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.880
Honestly, I just wanna pull it!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:54.000
<b>WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU PULL MOMO'S STRING?</b>

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:54.000
Pop quiz. What happens if you pull Momo's string?

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU PULL MOMO'S STRING?</b>

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.500
Number 1: Her skirt falls down.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>Her skirt falls down.</b>

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.380
Number 2: Her panties fall down.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>Her panties fall down.</b>

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.330
Number 3: Both her skirt and panties fall down.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>Both her skirt and panties fall down.</b>

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.000
Number 4: Sadly, it's only a decorative thing.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>Sadly, it's only</b>

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>a decorative thing.</b>

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:06.170
<b>Nothing falls down.</b>

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.290
Nothing falls down.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.920
Twitch, twitch, twitch, twitch, twitch

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.250
Pardon me a moment!

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:08.790
Shamiko?!

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.830
I don't know what your deal is, but calm down.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.420
I'm sorry!

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.830
Ding, ding, ding! The correct answer was this!
Did you get it right?

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:16.000
<b>WHAT HAPPENS IF PULL MOMO'S STRING?</b>

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:16.000
<b>SHAMIKO GETS PUT INTO A HOLD</b>

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:18.250
Anyways, let's do our best.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.670
I know this is important, but you can't
just break down people's doors!

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.880
Well, it's impossible to adjust
how much strength I'm using!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:27.790
<b>Shudderrrr</b>

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.790
What? So you might have totally obliterated me
with that move a minute ago...?

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.290
Wake up, Mikan!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.330
Huh? Wuzzat? Why do you look like that?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.580
I need you to strike my core
as hard as possible without killing me!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.290
What?!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:41.130
Oh gosh, I'm sorry! I'm so sorry about this!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.830
We don't have time! Hurry and transform!
Then go outside! Move it, move it!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:43.080
C'mon! Hurry it up! Chop chop! There's no time to waste!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.080
What the heck is going on?!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.170
<b>BANDA TERRACE</b>

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:07.790
What is the big deal?
This is SO not how I wanted to wake up!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.420
<b>BANDA TERRACE</b>

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.630
Did it work?

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:11.290
Nope. I'm not reverting back.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:14.830
Well, it wasn't me because I put my heart
into that shot and gave it everything that I had.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:18.130
But you're so mean! How dare you wake me up like this!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.420
Making me shoot an arrow at you!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:20.880
Put yourself in my shoes, darn it!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.670
It's the worst way to start the day!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.170
My bad. I'm sorry... seriously.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.380
Okay then, you're welcome!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:32.880
It would be nice if you guys
could put yourself in my shoes, too.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.170
Seeing as how I always get swept up in Mikan's curse...

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.500
How'd you get all the way up there, Ancestor?

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.630
Hey Shamiko, can you get in touch with Café Asura?

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:42.290
Sure.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.670
Good gracious. That sounds like a real pickle!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:48.960
Unfortunately, my medicine requires a teeny-weeny bit
of time to take full effect after you have a dose.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.040
There's not much hope of it working
if things are already wonky.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:56.380
Not to mention that keeping your qi in balance is really
only useful to help prevent bad things from happening.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.250
Is that so...?

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.670
You sound down in the dumps.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:04.080
D-don't worry! It would've been too late
even if you had taken my medicine the other day!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.130
It's not your fault for refusing it!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.460
You're good, so just pass into the afterlife
without any regrets!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.080
Lico! Your attempt to reassure her
is only having the opposite effect!

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.290
Why don't you try asking Sion Ogura?

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.420
She may be able to offer a good solution.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:18.290
I have her number on my phone in my room.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.380
<b>BUSTED!!!</b>

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.250
Busteeeeeeed...

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.250
It's broken!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.380
The screen is totally shattered!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.380
Oh crap... that must have happened
when the alarm woke me up.

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.960
Now how do we contact her?

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.580
Faaaade...

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:30.250
M-Momo?! Is it just me or are you
becoming see-through somehow?!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.040
This is bad. I'm almost out of magic!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.460
Then we have to hurry and get a hold of Ogura!

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:36.420
Oh no... What to do? What to do?!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.210
Looking for me?

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.790
Oh! It's Ogura!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.080
I got the sense I was in big demand, so here I am!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.630
But how did you know...?

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.500
Because I was listening on a tiny mic
that I installed in your demon god statue.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.500
I had no idea she put that inside of me...

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.630
<b>I had no idea she put that inside of me...</b>

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:49.710
Also, I've been patrolling through your neighborhood
for 5 days a week just by coincidence.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.000
Well, whatever! Thank you very much!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:57.250
Oh, Shamiko. Despite the small misgivings you just had,
your gratefulness won out in the end, huh?

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.580
Thank you so much!

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:02.380
My interested was so piqued after everything that
happened last time that I've been researching non-stop

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.330
and waiting for an opportunity to help out!

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.290
That's nice, but stalking is a crim-! Mmph!

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.210
Do you know why I suddenly fell to the darkness?

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.460
This is just conjecture on my part,

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:13.500
but I think it was negative feelings you were having
that triggered the change.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.920
Negative feelings?

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:19.250
Jealousy, paranoia, greed.
Any of the adverse type like that.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:24.830
I've found many records throughout history
that describe people related to the Light Clan

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.790
who fell to the darkness all by themselves
after being overwhelmed with negative feelings.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.880
Normally, it's not something that can happen so easily.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.330
However, your core has been in an delicate position

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.580
<b>Negative Gusts</b>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.580
<b>Light</b>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.580
<b>Core</b>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.580
<b>Darkness</b>

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.670
since that last incident,

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:42.580
<b>Negative Gusts</b>

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:42.580
<b>Light</b>

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:42.580
<b>Core</b>

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:42.580
<b>Darkness</b>

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.000
which made you very susceptible

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.250
to plummeting to the dark side!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.330
That's a pretty elaborate diagram.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.290
I get the feeling she saw this coming a mile away

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:42.580
and prepared for it ahead of time.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.330
So, how can I change back?

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:50.420
As it stands, your core has slipped and switched over to
the dark class, which broke your link with the Light Clan.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.380
All you need to do is make yourself happy again

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.380
by dealing with whatever negative feelings
you've been having lately.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:59.790
That will reestablish your link with the Light Clan
and make it so you can return to normal! Maybe!

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:00.500
In other words...?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:05.670
You gotta come totally clean and vent about
all the stuff that's been getting on your nerves lately!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.080
All right, then I'm cool with just fading away like this.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.540
No way! Don't you dare give up!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.830
Momo! Please tell me what's been
making you so unhappy lately!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.000
I have an idea of what caused it,
but I don't want to talk about it here!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.330
Come on! What happened to all that
"let's do our best" stuff?!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:19.330
You realize I'm gonna be a sobbing mess
if you disappear on us!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.130
Nobody goes through life without
publicly embarrassing themselves once or twice!

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:24.250
Well, yesterday...

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.380
...after everything that happened, I wasn't able to relax
and enjoy the lunch Shamiko made.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:30.210
Even though I did all my homework.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.670
I had been really looking forward to it.
Momoaaaan....<b></b>

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.830
THAT'S what drove you to the dark side?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.750
The truth is I'm a very small-minded
and boring individual.

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.250
Gotta admit, that's kind of adorable.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:40.500
Psheeeeew...

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.790
I just wanna drop off the face of the Earth right now.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.630
Well, Momo is on the verge of a breakdown in more ways
than one, so let's hurry and feed her a lunch.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.630
R-right!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.630
What to make? What to make?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:48.540
<b>What to make?</b>

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:49.500
<b>What to make?</b>

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:55.960
What to make? What to make?

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.580
But you know, it takes a lot of time to make a lunch.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:55.040
Momo's magic might run dry while I'm still cooking!

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:55.960
Hold up, Shamiko.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.330
You have one already! Just look in the fridge.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.290
What do you think? How does it look?

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:07.290
Yeah, that's the one! The first lunch
that you worked really hard to make!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.830
The dead leaf colored lunch!

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.580
No. I don't wanna serve her this!

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:14.580
There isn't time for anything else! Besides,
this is a lunch you made all on your own. Be proud of it!

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.500
Dead leaf colored...

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.540
I think it's a nice lunch that seems just like you.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:21.880
What the heck does that mean?! Just shut up and eat it!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.500
One problem. I can't hold my chopsticks.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.630
Aw, jeez! Then open your mouth!

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.330
Ahhh....

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:29.710
Omelette!

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:34.420
Huff! Puff! Huff! Puff! Huff! Puff! Huff! Puff!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.420
Is it good? Do you like it? Are you satisfied?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.290
I'm back!

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.500
You did it!

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.130
Thanks, everybody.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.670
I'm sorry for all the trouble.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:48.080
You'll need to be quick to regulate
any chaotic emotions that you have from now on.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:48.460
Huh?

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:52.000
Well, you're going to remain susceptible
to slipping over to the dark side for some time.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:55.880
And if it happens again,
I hope you'll let me come take more data!

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:56.420
What?!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.880
So this is gonna keep happening?!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:04.710
Don't give up, Momo! Learn to diffuse the mental bomb
you carry by staying tough and aware in life.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.210
Momp-momp...

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.460
Momo looks down for the count.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.670
Are you all right?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.460
My core is exhausted.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:26.040
I used up so much of my magic after
I unintentionally went back to the dark side.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.880
But... it'll recover with time. I just need to take it easy.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.040
There's a fix for that!

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:34.960
I know a place that will get Chiyoda
back on her feet! Lickity-split!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.000
<b>SLINK...</b>

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:36.750
O-Ogura?!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.130
And the name of that place is none other than:
Sakura Chiyoda's Secret Spring!

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:41.710
Great, but I'd like to know
why you came out of the ceiling first!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.540
I mean, if you want to know why I'm in the attic,
then it's because there's an attic for me to be in!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.500
How philosophic.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.420
My sister has a secret spring?

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:51.380
I'd love to explain, but...

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:52.880
Shloop.

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.380
Slink.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.920
I'm afraid that I can't get down because it's higher
than I thought, so could you help me with that first?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.710
You didn't rehearse this?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.330
I was too excited, so I didn't.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:09.710
I'll make sure there's a ladder next time.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:12.460
You're really planning to pop out from up above again?

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.040
Thanks for waiting!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:18.580
Sakura Chiyoda's Secret Spring is a special place
where magical girls can rejuvenate themselves!

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:20.630
Rejuvenate themselves?

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:21.420
Yep!

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:23.960
Very deep inside the mountainous region of Tama,

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:27.170
there is a mystical spring of water
that contains super-duper strong magic!

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:32.460
Apparently, it started as pure water that gushed out and
formed a puddle in the depths of an uninhabited cave.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:37.080
But then a hole coincidentally opened up
in the ceiling of that cave and...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.290
MOONLIGHT SHINED DOWN LIKE FLASH!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.380
MAGIC WENT IN THE WATER LIKE ZAAAP!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.040
NEGATIVE IONS FLEW IN LIKE KAWOOOOSH!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:47.080
AND A NATURAL SPRING
OF MYTHICAL WATER WAS BOOOORN!

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.500
A miracle created through pure happenstance!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.580
A TRUE WONDER OF NATURE!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:51.580
Whoa there, you're all over the place.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:55.330
All an injured magical girl has to do
is submerge themselves in that water

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.040
and their ether body will be healed!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.830
How did you find out about such a wonderful place?

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:04.000
I read about it in the notes
that Chiyoda's big sister wrote!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:04.790
Huh?

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:08.670
Oh, right. I left all the documents and notes
that belonged to my sister with Ogura.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.290
I couldn't figure out what any of them said.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.290
I'm working hard to decipher them all!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:17.290
A healing spring sounds like something
straight out of a video game! I wanna go see it!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:22.290
You've got some pretty dark stains on you, so you should
take a long soak. That will make them easy to get out!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.830
Quit making me sound like dirty laundry
that needs to be washed.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.080
I put the location data in a map app for you.

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.830
And while you're there, get some samples
of that water to bring back for me!

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.750
Mythical water is a fundamental ingredient in alchemy!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.460
You're not going to come with us?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:37.290
I'm an indoors person.
So hiking a mountain in summer would kill me.

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.790
I think it's probably more bearable
than being in a stuffy attic.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.380
Thank you. We'll go check it out.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:42.540
A mountain?

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.380
Sorry, I think I'm gonna have to pass on this one.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.290
Why?!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.500
I have to go to an interview
as part of my school transfer request.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:53.000
<b>TRANSFER APPROVED             STILL A STUDENT</b>

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:53.960
And if I skip out on it, then I can't change schools!
Which means I'll lose my status as a student!

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.250
<b>TRANSFER DENIED                      STUDENT</b>

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:55.920
With no school to attend,
Mikan becomes one of those people

00:14:54.250 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>With no school to attend,</b>

00:14:54.250 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>Mikan becomes one of those people</b>

00:14:54.250 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>who always loiters around the park in the afternoon.</b>

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.580
who always loiters around the park in the afternoon.

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:58.750
Mikaaaan.

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:00.420
Oh, that is a big deal. Do your best.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:21.420
<b>DEEP INNER TAMA STATION</b>

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.000
Deep Inner Tama Station.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.540
Hey, I've been here before.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.290
Oh really?

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.330
Yeah, because I missed my stop.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:26.790
So I guess the place we're going to
is private property that my sister owns.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.920
It's out in the middle of nowhere, but it looks like
we can reach it by following the mountain trails.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:33.790
There's a sign up ahead!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:42.170
<b>WARNING</b>

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:42.170
<b>This area is private property.</b>

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.040
"This area is private property."

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:42.170
<b>Because valuable resources can be found here,</b>

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:42.170
<b>many traps have been laid to help prevent theft</b>

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:42.170
<b>and also just because it's fun.</b>

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.130
"Because valuable resources can be found here,

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:41.670
many traps have been laid to help prevent theft
and also just because it's fun."

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:52.080
<b>...However</b>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:52.080
<b>If you insist on entering,</b>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:52.080
<b>then I hope you enjoy the difficulty of reaching the treasure!!</b>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:52.080
<b>I know the only people who would bother coming out here</b>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:52.080
<b>are my friends and family anyways!</b>

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:52.080
<b>-Chiyoda, the landlord</b>

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:46.500
...however, if you insist on entering then I hope
you enjoy the difficulty of reaching the treasure!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.290
I know the only people who would bother coming out
here are my friends and family anyways.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.000
Chiyoda, the landlord.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.790
What is she trying to say with this?

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.460
I'm not sure I get it either...

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.380
What kind of traps prevent thieves?

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:59.500
She probably used magic booby traps and familiars.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.920
F-familiars?!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:05.920
<b>Many traps have been laid to help prevent</b>

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:05.920
<b>theft and also just because it's fun.</b>

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:05.750
Many traps have been laid to help prevent theft
and also just because it's fun.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:15.380
Considering my sister's personality, it's nothing deadly
and just stuff that'll comedically beat us up.

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.960
But I need you to fight since I'm too weak right now.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:21.750
So what, you want me to walk into non-lethal traps
and get comedically beaten up?!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.380
Yep, let's mov-

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.500
MOMOOOO!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.960
La-dee-da, here I go!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.960
This trap is safe even if somebody
totally ordinary stumbled upon it.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.000
Aaah! A pitfall!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.000
It's a pitfall expertly designed

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>SAFETY LADDER</b>

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>TOTALLY OKAY</b>

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>TO FALL IN!</b>

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>SHOCK-ABSORBING CUSHIONS</b>

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>EMERGENCY BUTTON</b>

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>Presented by: The Safe Pitfall Committee</b>

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.710
to meet with all compliance measures.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:31.960
Oh, that wasn't so bad.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:31.960
<b>FULLY            TESTED</b>

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.960
It was a just simple pitfall!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.580
Where's the magic in that?!

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:40.500
Let's keep moving. This is a challenge from my sister.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.540
I totally want to get my hands on that treasure!

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:44.500
You seem oddly motivated about this...

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.380
Well, I'm a little ticked off.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.040
Shamiko. You walk in front.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.330
That's cheating, darn it!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:57.630
No, I'm giving us an equal opportunity to hit a pitfall.
Consider it part of your training.

00:16:57.630 --> 00:16:58.830
New experiences are- hnrg!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.080
MOMO!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.210
Momo...!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.330
Momo...!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.960
It was cute hearing you go "hnrg."

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.000
She set traps that can trigger from behind, too?!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.380
Momooooope...

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.960
Welp. Time to go home.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.540
As if! Don't you dare give up!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.290
I'm about to slip over to the dark side again.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:19.580
Intruder. Intruder. Intruder.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.420
In-in-in-intruder.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:25.460
Go back. Go back. Go ba-ba-ba-ba-back.

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.250
Oh, now that's more like it!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:28.130
Clench.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:27.830
<b>Clench</b>

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.500
What the heck is that?

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:29.920
A wad of black licorice out for revenge?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.380
It's a familiar that can operate on its own.

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:37.920
Gachunk! Gachunk! Gachunk! Gachunk!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.080
Prepare for combat, Shadow Mistress!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.920
Wah! I wasn't ready for this
to suddenly turn into a hardcore battle!

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.130
CRISIS MANAGEMENT FOOOORM!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:18.790
Stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.880
It's been set at a pretty weak level.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:08.330
Calm down! It's moving slower than you think!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.750
Watching how your opponent moves is fighting 101!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.630
Familiars have something similar to a core,
so aim for that!

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.380
I dunno what that looks like!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:17.290
Please give me a hint!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.000
A hint, huh?

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.460
You'd think the pink stone on its chest
would be obvious enough...

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:23.790
Just try thinking about it by yourself for a minute!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.670
You're such a mean instructor!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:28.210
Upsy-daisy, upsy-daisy, upsy-daisy.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:34.130
Fidget, fidget... Fidget, fidget...

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:34.130
Hey! This thing can't climb up to high places!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.250
So how about we just wait here until it gives up?

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:39.380
We can't navigate the mountain trail at night,
so you gotta hurry this up.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.670
Um... er... it's weak point...

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:46.580
I can't find it! Oh, but I guess it doesn't matter
where it is if I just attack all over the place.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.790
Okay, Whatchamacallit Rod!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.210
Copy Mode: Mikan's Weapon!

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:54.380
Whoa!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.540
I... I won!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.790
I never figured out its weak point, but I still won!

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:06.880
W-well, I guess that worked out...

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.630
It looks like a cheap knock-off, but it copied
the abilities of the original pretty well.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:12.960
It has such a weird construction.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.750
Heh-heh!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:13.750
It's so convenient!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.670
<b>IT'S SO CONVENIENT!</b>

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.540
Yeah, that's for sure.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:18.420
It's my first demonic victory! Yahoo! Yahoo!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:22.130
<b>THIS WAS THE WEAK POINT!</b>

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:21.790
By the way, the pink stone
on its chest was the weak point.

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.710
That makes sense!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:26.040
Hey, can I take this stone home with me?

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.790
I don't see why not. It belongs to my sister, anyway.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.460
It's gonna be my treasure that I polish every day!

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:34.130
Ah! I also wanna take home some dirt
from the spot where I first claimed a victory.

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.080
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho!

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.290
Say, Momo? Could you snap a picture of me?

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.080
You realize you're not a baseball player, right?

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:44.420
<b>THE DEMON GIRL CLAIMED HER SPOILS OF WAR</b>

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:43.630
This is gonna be my treasure!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.630
We finally made it...

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.170
So, this is Sakura Chiyoda's Secret Spring.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.540
It's more of a waterfall, really...

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.290
Yep. Just a waterfall.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.210
Are you going to skinny-dip, or did you bring a swimsuit?

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.580
Or maybe white training garbs? Or a loincloth?!

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:01.210
Will you quit being silly! I'm going in just like this!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:18.210
Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow! Wow!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:13.040
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:13.330
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:13.880
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:14.540
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:14.750
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:21.710
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:21.710
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:21.710
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:21.710
<b>Wow!</b>

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.210
Seeing Momo get hit by this waterfall is so funny!

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:21.500
Can you stop with the bouncy tail, please?

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.960
How is it Momo? Do you feel any different?

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:31.170
I feel nothing.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:39.960
I swear, the friendlier we get
the more of a nuisance you become!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.330
Ka-splash...

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.750
Look! Your body has started glowing a little bit, Momo!

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:49.750
I'm feeling better somehow.
I guess this stuff must really work.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:54.290
Think I could do this at home if we called a contractor
and had them take it all back in a tanker truck?

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:57.500
Hold on, I'm betting it wouldn't be as effective
without the leylines around here.

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:59.830
I thought standing under waterfalls
was supposed to cleanse wicked thoughts...

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:01.290
<b>BANDA TERRACE</b>

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.170
Amazing!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.750
You brought back so much
of the mythical water for me, thanks!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.380
It was really rough...

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:09.710
Care to explain why you're making a lab in my kitchen?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.880
Because there's a kitchen for me to use!

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.250
What's that?

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.040
Oh!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.960
This is a little prize that I picked up after winning a bat-

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.000
Oh! My! Gosh!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.710
O-outstanding! Such a high-quality pink gem!

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:25.210
It's a super ultra power stone that's incredibly valuable!

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:26.540
You don't say?

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.880
It's even better than the mythical water!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.000
But it's my treasur-

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.330
Thank you so much!

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:31.750
Huh?

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.330
This is the greatest souvenir of all time!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.250
You two really are the best!

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:36.580
Oh joy! Oh joy!

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.380
Listen, it's actually my treasure that I won and...!

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.960
<b>GRIND</b>

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.960
<b>GRIND</b>

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.960
<b>GRIND</b>

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.960
<b>GRIND</b>

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:42.000
Yes! I can make you the ultimate elixir with this!

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:45.040
<b>GRIND          GRIND           GRIND           GRIND      </b>

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:44.750
Just you wait, Shamikooooooo!

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:48.580
<b>My treasure...</b>

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.670
My treasure...

00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:15.540
Listen. It's okay because your beautiful memories
of that moment will live on in your heart forever.

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:17.920
You're not gonna get me to fall for that sappy crap!

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:22.580
Don't give up, Shamiko! At the very least,
display the dirt you got by putting it in a nice glass jar.

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:25.380
Now to have that girl pack up
and get out of my apartment.

00:22:44.080 --> 00:22:46.670
Mata aeta ne drama nandatte? (howa howa)

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:49.670
Sugu (sugu!) oshie ni mo icchauzo (utou!)

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:52.580
Kakyuuteki naruhaya de (saa!)

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:55.210
Ara post mo "ohayou" nante (pikopiko)

00:22:55.210 --> 00:22:57.420
Mou shippo made saeteru (waa!)

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:01.250
Hakusen o tondette itsu mentsudoeba

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:04.000
Kyou mo hajimatteku

00:23:04.170 --> 00:23:07.790
Totsuzen ni mystery

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:11.170
Kurakura mayou kedo

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:15.710
Te to te o tori doko made mo susume

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:22.630
Guruguru machi wa mawari kagayaku

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.540
Korokoro toehatae shite

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.250
Yume o mazeta yoikagen wa

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:31.210
Kimi ni hana o sakaseru yo

00:23:31.210 --> 00:23:34.040
Yomo made kakomu tetragon

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.000
Aa machikado ni hanataba

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:39.960
Nee ima wa mou sukoshi

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:44.000
Sottosotto sono hana o misete

00:23:44.210 --> 00:23:47.500
Yokubacchaeba mou ikkai

00:23:56.040 --> 00:24:10.960
<b>PREVIEW</b>

00:23:57.080 --> 00:24:00.580
Momo! Is the power of Ms. Sakura's
spring working on you?

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:03.580
Yeah, there's a pleasant warmth
enveloping my whole body.

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:06.080
Shamiko, I need your help! But please don't scoop it up!

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:06.750
Huh?!

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:08.960
Now it's time for us to train your magic power, Shamiko!

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:10.960
<b>THE ANCESTOR'S DOJO?! DEMONKIND'S ULTIMATE WEAPON</b>

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:10.830
Hey, I know a good way to do that!
